ArrayFindFirst:
Return first item in array that matches the predicate function.

<pre>
 users = [ { name: "Ada" }, { name: "Grace" } ];
 users.findFirst( ( user ) => user.name == "Grace" ); // { name: "Grace" }
 users.findFirst( ( user ) => user.name == "Linus", "Unknown" ); // "Unknown"
 </pre>

